abstract: >
  NeuroBloom is a web-based platform for longitudinal cognitive monitoring
  and clinician-supervised rehabilitation planning in multiple sclerosis.
  It provides adaptive cognitive training, longitudinal analytics, clinician
  review, and bilingual (English/Bengali) support.

keywords:
  - multiple sclerosis
  - digital health
  - cognitive rehabilitation
  - cognitive monitoring
  - softwarex
  - neuropsychology
